## Initial Q&A
### Is Kamala Harris a United States Senator?
Answer: Yes, according to the source, "Harris, a Democrat, represented California in the U.S. Senate from 2017 to 2021," meaning that at the time of the claim (October 14, 2020), Kamala Harris was indeed a sitting United States Senator.

