Answer: Yes, the search result confirms that Kamala Harris took the bar exam. The source, written by a classmate from UC Hastings College of Law (Class of 1989), states that the author "passed the bar exam the first time I sat for it and was admitted in December of 1989," while Harris "was not admitted until June of 1990," implying she took the California bar exam to become a licensed attorney.

